TS) and at least 3 years of experience. RNCP level 7 qualification.\n\nIELTS Academic - 6.0 to 6.5 // TOFEL IBT : Minimum of 84, TOEUC : Minimum 650-655 and Dualingo :- Minimum 100 to 110','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:49','2026-07-13 23:24:35',NULL);
