EA, DESS, etc.) or professional diploma at BAC + 5 level, Title registered with the RNCP at level 7 Foreign diploma equivalent to the French diplomas required above.\n\nIELTS Academic - 6.0 to 6.5 // TOFEL IBT : Minimum of 84, TOEUC : Minimum 650-655 and Dualingo :- Minimum 100 to 110','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:49','2026-07-13 23:24:35',NULL);
