gement Training and Diplomas (CEFDG) to award the Master\'s degree (Master 2) Postgraduate university diploma (DEA, DESS, etc.) whose list is determined by the Conference of Grandes Ecoles Foreign diploma equivalent to the French diplomas required above: Master 1, Bac +4 or equivalent level (240 ECTS) and at least 3 years of experience. RNCP level 7 qualification.\n\nIELTS Academic - 6.0 to 6.5 // TOFEL IBT : Minimum of 84, TOEUC : Minimum 650-655 and Dualingo :- Minimum 100 to 110','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:49','2026-07-13 23:24:35',NULL);
