at a higher level and issued by an official education institution. N.B. Students seeking to enter the program at this level (3rd-year) must have pursued studies in the field of management comparable to the contents of the first two years of the Global BBA program.\n\nIELTS: Minimum score of 6.5; TOEFL iBT: Minimum score of 90','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:49','2026-07-13 23:24:35',NULL);
