egin their studies in September 2025. The test fee will be deducted from the tuition fee payment.\n\nHigh school diploma and a certified English translation of your high school diploma if it is not in English.','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:50','2026-07-13 23:24:37',NULL);
