ther accepted English language certifications. To qualify, applicants must present their Duolingo test result to IBS and begin their studies in September 2025. The test fee will be deducted from the tuition fee payment.','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:50','2026-07-13 23:24:37',NULL);
