o see if this requirement applies to you); -Receipt of entrance fee ( 100 € )\n\n- a certificate proving the level of English (not lower than B2; approval is required if the master\'s thesis was written in a language other than English).','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:50','2026-07-13 23:24:40',NULL);
