sible to fresh graduates, working executives, and self-employed professionals 2. Minimum 60% in English in the qualifying exam. If not met, applicants must clear the Manipal Enablers English Competency Test and/or complete a 6-week Bridge Program with a minimum 60% pass grade. If the medium of instruction was not English, submit IELTS/TOEFL with an overall score of 6','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:50','2026-07-13 23:24:41',NULL);
