/university with Mathematics, Statistics, or Programming as part of their qualifying degree from a recognized institutions A minimum of 50% aggregate marks in their undergraduate degree. 2. Minimum 60% in English in the qualifying exam. If not met, applicants must clear the Manipal Enablers English Competency Test and/or complete a 6-week Bridge Program with a minimum 60% pass grade. If the medium of instruction was not English, submit IELTS/TOEFL with an overall score of 6.','active',NULL,'2026-07-03 03:31:50','2026-07-13 23:24:41',NULL);
